<title>USA: Iridex sees delivery delays hurting sales.</title>
<headline>Iridex sees delivery delays hurting sales.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iridex Corp said on Monday that delivery delays are likely to hurt its sales during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Deliveries of diodes for its OcuLight GL laser have been a problem area for awhile and delays are expected to continue for the next few months, the company said.</p>
</text>
